    <briefdescription>
<para>This class collects the events of a MIDI export and builds the MIDI JSON from them. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classvrv_1_1_doc_1ae3fd9cb4a6ebcefba2c832266159ee3e" kindref="member">Doc::ExportMIDI()</ref> and <ref refid="classvrv_1_1_generate_m_i_d_i_functor" kindref="compound">GenerateMIDIFunctor</ref> add every event they write to the MIDI file here too, with the same track, tick, channel and values, and the ID of the note for note-on events. The events of a track are kept in the order of the MIDI file, so that an event can be found by its index. <ref refid="classvrv_1_1_m_i_d_i_json_builder_1a4555c1b60c4b6489a235fda9c2516ab4" kindref="member">Finalize()</ref> builds the JSON once all events are collected. The structure is the one of @tonejs/midi (Midi.toJSON()) with the ID added to each note. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
